*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&  Include           ZMM_MASS_STOCK_INTAKE_SSC
*&  Selection screen definition
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* FILE UPLOAD
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b_file WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-t01.
  PARAMETERS: p_file TYPE localfile OBLIGATORY.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b_file.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* POSTING OPTIONS
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b_post WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-t02.

  " Movement type pair (radio group)
  PARAMETERS: rb_561 RADIOBUTTON GROUP mvt DEFAULT 'X',
              rb_501 RADIOBUTTON GROUP mvt.

  SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

  PARAMETERS: p_budat TYPE budat DEFAULT sy-datum OBLIGATORY.
  PARAMETERS: p_bktxt TYPE bktxt.
  PARAMETERS: p_xblnr TYPE xblnr_d.

SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b_post.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP 1.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* TEST MODE
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK b_test WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-t03.
  PARAMETERS: p_test AS CHECKBOX DEFAULT 'X'.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK b_test.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* SELECTION SCREEN EVENTS
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR p_file.
  " Open file browser dialog (F4 help)
  CALL FUNCTION 'KD_GET_FILENAME_ON_F4'
    EXPORTING
      static    = abap_true
      mask      = '*.csv;*.xlsx'
    CHANGING
      file_name = p_file.
